{"overclaims":[{"abstract":"The data were analyzed thematically and the results are four themes of experiencing the teaching of digital models, indicating that technology teachers teach with different aims and purposes; _Enhancing and integrating other subjects, Visualizing technology to the pupils, Enabling digital modelling,_ and _Preparing pupils for the future_.","body":"In this study, the aims and purposes of teaching digital models are described in four themes, partly overlapping each other.","body_loc":"results_evidence","cell_sentence_id":"results.2","why":"The abstract presents four distinct themes, but the body says they partly overlap, and the caveats add that the same teacher can hold experiences from different themes."},{"abstract":"Further, the results also indicate that the content and methods of teaching differ and that teachers did not experience digital models as one single idea but as an amalgam of multiple ideas.","body":"The synthesis shows that teaching digital models is not centered on only one objective, and teaching content and methods may differ","body_loc":"results_evidence","cell_sentence_id":"results.3","why":"The abstract says content and methods of teaching differ, but the body only says they \"may differ\", a weaker and tentative claim."}],"unsettled":["These findings can be used as a basis for further research and development of teaching concerning digital models."]}